{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/logos/logotipo_horizontal.png\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0tvgixas_zznn.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/19mx3mg6lkumu.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/27t_qfc-3_lzs.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2-rtuqsgzmno4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-1b6uko1cu_h42.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3fntmmi971322.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/22i43cg4l4-dq.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>NX Quality</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Control de calidad operativa para exportadoras y precstadores de inspección.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F7F6F2] text-[#2C2C2C] selection:bg-amber-200/40\"><nav class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 py-6 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/logos/logotipo_horizontal.png\" alt=\"NX Quality\" class=\"h-14 w-auto max-w-[280px]\"/></a><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#4A5D23] hover:text-[#324814] transition-colors\" href=\"/login\">Acceder</a></nav><section class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-36 md:pb-24\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1a1a1a]\">Control de calidad de fruta, <br/><span class=\"italic font-light text-[#5A6E3C]\">hecho operativo.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-8 text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[#555550] max-w-2xl\">Transformamos los datos de cada inspección — fruta, lote, evidencia — en decisiones comerciales y trazables. No almacenamos por almacenar; respaldamos la calidad que exporta su empresa.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-6\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#4A5D23] px-8 py-4 text-base font-medium text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#4A5D23]/20 hover:bg-[#3a4a1b] hover:shadow-xl transition-all\" href=\"/login\">Iniciar sesión</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#1a1a1a]/10 px-8 py-4 text-base font-medium text-[#1a1a1a] hover:bg-[#1a1a1a]/5 transition-colors\" href=\"/login\">Ver ejemplo de inspección</a></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 pb-24 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 border border-[#1a1a1a]/5 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-[#1a1a1a]\">Inspección por lote</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[#555550] leading-relaxed\">Registre mediciones, fotografías y decisiones por cada lote de fruta con trazabilidad completa.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 border border-[#1a1a1a]/5 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-[#1a1a1a]\">Calidad como respaldo</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[#555550] leading-relaxed\">El sistema convierte datos operativos en evidencia comercial para exportaciones y auditorías.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 border border-[#1a1a1a]/5 shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-[#1a1a1a]\">Trazabilidad completa</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[#555550] leading-relaxed\">Desde la inspección inicial hasta la decisión comercial: cada lote, cada evidencia, cada resultado registrado con trazabilidad operativa.</p></div></section><footer class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-8 py-14 border-t border-[#1a1a1a]/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-10 md:gap-16\"><div><a href=\"https://www.nxchile.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[#1a1a1a] hover:text-[#4A5D23] transition-colors\">NXChile</a><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#777] max-w-md\">Tecnología operacional que ordena procesos de inspección y trazabilidad de fruta. Hecho en Chile para la realidad chilena.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end gap-x-10 gap-y-4 text-sm text-[#555550]\"><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#777] mb-1\">Contacto</p><a href=\"mailto:contacto@nxchile.com\" class=\"hover:text-[#4A5D23] transition-colors\">contacto@nxchile.com</a></div><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#777] mb-1\">WhatsApp</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/56977412178\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-[#4A5D23] transition-colors\">+56 9 7741 2178</a></div><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#777] mb-1\">Instagram</p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nx_chile\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hover:text-[#4A5D23] transition-colors\">@nx_chile</a></div><div><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#777] mb-1\">Sitio</